WEBVTT

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.926
This "hole" came to be
five years ago...

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.766
...in a large apartment complex
in Machida...

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.897
...due to diastrophic disturbances
of unknown origin.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.975
Collapse of Machida apartment
complex continuing
Its collapse has continued...

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:11.811
Collapse of Machida apartment
complex continuing
...and the entire building is on the
verge of being swallowed up.

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.871
Collapse of Machida apartment
complex continuing
At this rate, it may spread to the
surrounding residential area...

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:16.282
Damage has spread
to the city as well
This is continuing coverage...

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:20.253
Damage has spread
to the city as well
...of the unexplained scattered
body part murders in Yoyogi Park.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.055
Damage has spread
to the city as well
According to police reports,

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:25.425
Damage has spread
to the city as well
there have been eight murders,
mostly homeless people.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:27.927
Damage has spread
to the city as well
They still haven't found clues
of the culprit's identity...

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.224
Damage has spread
to the city as well
...and there have been
suggestions...

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.559
We're at the coastal district,

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:33.293
but one of the mysterious holes
has shown up here.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.564
It is believed that the hole is
approximately 30 to 50 meters deep...

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.036
...and that the liquefaction
was caused...

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:42.974
...by a rash of earthquakes,
but the details are unknown...

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.670
Inspector Ibuki is here.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:45.769
Let her in.

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:53.149
Are you serious?

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:54.448
Yes.

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:57.251
I won't be able to protect you
this time.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.918
I've prepared myself.

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:34.950
Rage

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:42.483
Damn it!

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:43.689
Ranmaru!

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.228
I'm sorry.

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:52.432
This is hardest on you,
after all, Rokujo.

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:55.464
I'm all right.
I was ready for it.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:57.369
Rokujo.

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:03.506
I have nothing left to lose.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.949
I got it.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:06.941
Ryouko?

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:09.011
An arrest warrant for him.

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:11.922
Him? You mean Taishi?

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.222
Isn't that impossible,
even with that?

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:18.196
It might be. But this at least
makes it easier to act.

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:20.860
I see...

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:23.731
So where is he?

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.601
I have my guesses.

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.902
Then all that's left is to raid
the place.

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:29.875
Hold on a second, please.

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:32.969
He's not human, so what good
is arresting him?

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:36.345
I never said that we were going
to bring him in alive.

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:39.112
Our primary goal
is to take him down.

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:43.111
And reveal the truth.

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:45.283
Once we do that,

00:03:45.325 --> 00:03:47.987
we will also know who is connected
to the mass murders.

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:52.053
Um, about Taishi's
true identity...

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.690
To use their terms,

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:57.567
he's someone who's been
evolved, I guess.

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:01.296
The people aren't going
to be destroyed.

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:02.865
They're going to be reborn...

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:04.774
...into their evolved forms.

00:04:08.348 --> 00:04:09.975
I sensed it.

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:11.005
What?

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:15.919
The first time I met Taishi,
he had the same scent as us.

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:18.321
There is that possibility.

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:20.956
Do you remember...

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:24.191
...about the people that created
the Box of Druj?

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.925
Y-Yes...

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:29.697
The aristocracy, which was ruled
by power and ambition,

00:04:29.736 --> 00:04:31.499
ordered the alchemists
to open a door...

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:34.097
...to the world of darkness
so that they could obtain...

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:37.041
...the power of the devils
and create the Box of Druj.

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:38.100
But in the end,

00:04:38.144 --> 00:04:40.874
the aristocratic family
that summoned those phantoms...

00:04:40.913 --> 00:04:42.813
...was entirely wiped out.

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:45.048
So here's the question.

00:04:45.084 --> 00:04:49.282
Who resealed
those phantoms then?

00:04:49.322 --> 00:04:50.346
What?

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.018
More than likely,
it was the alchemists.

00:04:56.062 --> 00:04:58.053
Look at this.

00:04:59.032 --> 00:05:01.865
Isn't Yukino's present useful?

00:05:01.901 --> 00:05:05.302
There were twelve alchemists.

00:05:05.338 --> 00:05:07.704
And there were twelve survivors
at Machida.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.300
And almost all of them
are symbionts.

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:12.072
What a strange coincidence.

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:20.349
Hey, why do I have to stay
in Inspector Ibuki's apartment?

00:05:20.386 --> 00:05:22.718
It can't be helped.
It's an order.

00:05:22.755 --> 00:05:23.847
Whose?

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.448
Inspector Ibuki's.

00:05:25.491 --> 00:05:26.480
Why?

00:05:26.526 --> 00:05:28.357
Because it's an order.

00:05:28.394 --> 00:05:29.588
Why?

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:31.494
I don't know why.

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:33.260
Thank you for coming.

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:35.961
H-Hello, Inspector Ibuki!

00:05:36.002 --> 00:05:37.026
Huh?

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:39.937
Big brother!
You have to salute!

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:42.440
R-Right.

00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:44.773
There's no need
for formal greetings.

00:05:44.811 --> 00:05:46.711
Now, come inside.

00:05:46.746 --> 00:05:50.807
Wow, it's so beautiful!

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:54.510
You can use anything in here
as you like.

00:05:54.554 --> 00:05:56.351
Saya, your room is, hmm...

00:05:56.389 --> 00:06:01.088
Wow! Look, big brother.
It's so fluffy!

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:02.526
Such a cute girl.

00:06:02.562 --> 00:06:04.086
Y-Yes.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.461
She should be safe here.

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:07.989
They shouldn't be able
to get in here very easily.

00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:12.660
Ryouko... is Saya really?

00:06:12.705 --> 00:06:13.967
Don't worry.

00:06:14.006 --> 00:06:16.497
This is just in case
worse comes to worse.

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:05.685
Hmph, you guys
are pretty stupid...

00:07:05.725 --> 00:07:08.159
...if you're breaking through security
just to get in.

00:07:29.949 --> 00:07:31.439
This is Shindo.

00:07:31.484 --> 00:07:32.473
Ranmaru?

00:07:32.518 --> 00:07:35.851
Some mimics have shown up!
Are you all right over there?

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:38.152
I'd like to say that, but...

00:07:38.191 --> 00:07:40.352
What's wrong?

00:07:40.393 --> 00:07:41.985
We're...

00:07:42.028 --> 00:07:43.620
...busy here, too.

00:07:52.872 --> 00:07:54.840
Hold up, damn it!

00:07:54.874 --> 00:07:56.808
Damn it!

00:07:58.711 --> 00:07:59.700
Stop it!

00:08:08.387 --> 00:08:09.411
Heh.

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:11.355
Three of you, huh?
Bring it on.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:12.755
I'm...

00:08:12.792 --> 00:08:14.783
...in a bad mood today!

00:08:30.076 --> 00:08:32.010
Hey, are you all right!?

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:37.774
Damn it...

00:08:37.817 --> 00:08:39.341
I see...

00:08:39.385 --> 00:08:42.218
So you're going to kill us,
one by one, huh?

00:08:43.556 --> 00:08:45.547
Big brother, here they are.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.763
You dummy,
hurry up and run!

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:02.100
Hmph.

00:09:13.953 --> 00:09:15.147
Are you all right?

00:09:15.187 --> 00:09:17.519
Y-Yeah...

00:09:17.557 --> 00:09:19.616
Hey, Mayu, we're going.

00:09:19.659 --> 00:09:20.990
Hold on, big brother!

00:09:21.027 --> 00:09:22.961
This person's hurt.

00:09:35.741 --> 00:09:36.799
Does it hurt?

00:09:36.842 --> 00:09:39.140
Yeah, I'm okay now.

00:09:39.178 --> 00:09:40.509
There's no need to worry.

00:09:40.546 --> 00:09:43.344
They're not in this area
anymore.

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:44.371
What?

00:09:44.417 --> 00:09:47.545
She can sense
the phantom's auras.

00:09:48.921 --> 00:09:50.183
Who are you?

00:09:50.222 --> 00:09:53.851
My name is Itto Araragi.

00:09:53.893 --> 00:09:56.157
This is my little sister, Mayu.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:58.419
Want to eat some?

00:09:58.464 --> 00:10:00.762
Eat... you can't mean?

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.700
Yeah, them.

00:10:02.735 --> 00:10:04.896
Who are you guys?

00:10:04.937 --> 00:10:07.838
My big brother
is a master phantom hunter.

00:10:07.873 --> 00:10:09.306
Phantom hunter?

00:10:09.342 --> 00:10:10.331
Yeah.

00:10:10.376 --> 00:10:14.836
I kill them and we eat
their meat.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.973
Why are you doing that?

00:10:17.016 --> 00:10:21.248
They ate our parents.

00:10:21.287 --> 00:10:25.280
That's why I decided
we would eat them back!

00:10:27.994 --> 00:10:32.431
And as we have,
we've gained new abilities.

00:10:35.568 --> 00:10:37.934
Oh, please don't mind us.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:41.133
How cute. Is she really
your little sister?

00:10:41.173 --> 00:10:43.368
What are you saying?

00:10:43.409 --> 00:10:44.876
Just so you know...

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.970
...the apartment's security system
didn't activate.

00:10:48.014 --> 00:10:50.346
So it was an inside job?

00:10:50.383 --> 00:10:53.352
The door to the control room
was destroyed.

00:10:53.386 --> 00:10:54.683
Ryouko!

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.779
There's nothing
to worry about here.

00:10:56.822 --> 00:10:59.222
As long as Ryouko
doesn't undo it herself.

00:11:00.393 --> 00:11:02.759
Oh, where are the siblings
that rescued you?

00:11:02.795 --> 00:11:05.696
Oh, afterwards, they got
on a motorcycle and...

00:11:05.731 --> 00:11:07.995
They're survivors
from Machida.

00:11:09.001 --> 00:11:14.234
I've met Itto and Mayu Araragi
once before.

00:11:14.273 --> 00:11:17.071
But back then,
they really were children...

00:11:17.109 --> 00:11:19.077
...and they were so frightened,

00:11:19.111 --> 00:11:22.046
they wouldn't listen to what
I had to say.

00:11:22.081 --> 00:11:25.073
And now they're
fully-fledged hunters.

00:11:25.918 --> 00:11:27.613
But it's strange.

00:11:27.653 --> 00:11:28.881
Strange?

00:11:28.921 --> 00:11:33.949
At that point, they had definitely
killed the phantom,

00:11:33.993 --> 00:11:37.394
but I couldn't find
the essential parts.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.921
And for them
to eat their meat...

00:11:41.534 --> 00:11:43.001
Ryouko?

00:11:43.035 --> 00:11:46.368
More than likely, the parts are inside
the two of them.

00:11:46.405 --> 00:11:48.339
What!?

00:11:48.374 --> 00:11:49.739
Here you go.

00:11:49.775 --> 00:11:51.675
Thank you!

00:11:51.711 --> 00:11:53.372
Oh, it smells nice.

00:11:53.412 --> 00:11:55.607
Hey, I'm sorry to ask this,

00:11:55.648 --> 00:11:58.617
but would you mind going
into the other room for a bit?

00:12:22.975 --> 00:12:23.964
Damn it!

00:12:24.009 --> 00:12:28.036
He was incredible...
He just sliced them up.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.106
I should have videotaped it
or something.

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.050
Yeah, but that's impossible.

00:12:33.085 --> 00:12:34.450
I know.

00:12:34.487 --> 00:12:36.546
All evidence is confiscated...

00:12:36.589 --> 00:12:38.386
...and we're under
a nondisclosure agreement.

00:12:38.424 --> 00:12:40.289
Jeez, this is sad.

00:12:40.326 --> 00:12:42.817
This would be a great topic to talk
about at a mixer, you know?

00:12:42.862 --> 00:12:44.955
Oops, if they hear me
talking like this...

00:12:44.997 --> 00:12:48.023
Oh yeah, is Mr. Muramasa
off today?

00:12:48.067 --> 00:12:51.525
No way that workaholic
would ever take a day off.

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:54.869
Just recently, he was even looking
at my computer.

00:12:54.907 --> 00:12:55.896
Yours?

00:12:55.941 --> 00:12:58.910
Yeah, he said he was checking
the data or something.

00:12:58.944 --> 00:13:01.105
He's probably looked
at yours, too.

00:13:01.147 --> 00:13:02.307
Really?

00:13:02.348 --> 00:13:04.782
T-This is bad,
I have porn-related data...

00:13:04.817 --> 00:13:06.876
- Hey!
- Y-Yes, sir!

00:13:06.919 --> 00:13:08.580
When did this happen?

00:13:08.621 --> 00:13:11.146
S-Sir! It was when
I was on night duty...

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:12.851
When I came back to the office,

00:13:12.892 --> 00:13:14.223
I just happened
upon Mr. Muramasa,

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:15.420
who was on my computer.

00:13:15.461 --> 00:13:19.454
But how did he check my computer
without my password?

00:13:28.941 --> 00:13:30.499
Taishi should be here.

00:13:30.543 --> 00:13:32.204
I'm amazed that you know.

00:13:32.244 --> 00:13:34.576
I put the screws
to one of his people.

00:13:34.613 --> 00:13:35.841
I see.

00:13:35.881 --> 00:13:37.439
His people?

00:13:37.483 --> 00:13:40.509
The people that want to get along
with the phantoms.

00:13:40.553 --> 00:13:43.852
You might say they're selling us off
to the phantoms...

00:13:43.889 --> 00:13:47.017
...just so they can save
themselves.

00:13:47.059 --> 00:13:49.084
You remember, right?

00:13:49.128 --> 00:13:53.963
The ones that attacked Saya
and hid the police evidence.

00:13:54.967 --> 00:13:56.491
They did?

00:13:57.536 --> 00:13:59.766
Did you think it was the work
of the Security Section?

00:13:59.805 --> 00:14:01.534
Y-Yes.

00:14:01.574 --> 00:14:05.101
They have allies
in the Security Section too.

00:14:05.144 --> 00:14:08.136
And they have allies
in the government as well.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.581
That's not all.

00:14:13.619 --> 00:14:16.520
It looks like they have people
in the Utagawa precinct too.

00:14:16.555 --> 00:14:17.715
What?

00:14:20.292 --> 00:14:21.987
Hey, who are you?

00:14:22.027 --> 00:14:24.461
We're police.
We have a warrant.

00:14:25.731 --> 00:14:27.062
Seeya.

00:14:44.216 --> 00:14:45.979
I guess
he's on the second floor.

00:14:46.018 --> 00:14:47.610
Yes.

00:15:07.306 --> 00:15:08.466
Here we go.

00:15:32.932 --> 00:15:33.921
Ranmaru?

00:15:33.966 --> 00:15:36.526
I have a really bad feeling
about this.

00:15:36.568 --> 00:15:37.728
What?

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:45.602
Big brother?

00:15:55.521 --> 00:15:56.920
Shindo!

00:15:56.956 --> 00:15:58.583
Damn it!

00:15:58.624 --> 00:15:59.613
Sakura!

00:16:06.398 --> 00:16:08.025
Damn.

00:16:19.511 --> 00:16:21.240
Ranmaru,
the room furthest in!

00:16:24.416 --> 00:16:25.644
Shindo!

00:16:30.322 --> 00:16:31.516
You're in the way!

00:16:38.163 --> 00:16:39.357
Shindo!

00:16:43.135 --> 00:16:45.194
I've been waiting for you.

00:16:45.237 --> 00:16:48.365
Sorry, but I have no interest
in your friends.

00:16:49.675 --> 00:16:53.372
You're the only one I need.

00:16:56.548 --> 00:16:59.642
So you want to kill me, eh?

00:16:59.685 --> 00:17:05.089
I don't mind.
Do whatever you like.

00:17:05.124 --> 00:17:10.858
But if you do, you'll be hurting
your precious friends.

00:17:10.896 --> 00:17:11.885
What!?

00:17:19.605 --> 00:17:20.594
Sakura! Kureha!

00:17:22.141 --> 00:17:24.735
And yet you still defy me?

00:17:24.777 --> 00:17:26.335
Why you!

00:17:29.882 --> 00:17:33.841
You really don't know anything,
do you?

00:17:33.886 --> 00:17:40.257
But I actually like your impatience
and rashness.

00:17:42.795 --> 00:17:43.784
Damn it!

00:17:43.829 --> 00:17:46.297
Do you hate me?

00:17:46.331 --> 00:17:48.492
I'll kill you...

00:17:48.534 --> 00:17:51.059
This is revenge for my dad
and my mom!

00:17:51.103 --> 00:17:52.798
That's right.

00:17:52.838 --> 00:17:57.537
I'm the one that drove your parents
to their deaths...

00:17:57.576 --> 00:18:00.044
...using a very cruel method.

00:18:02.481 --> 00:18:05.314
Hate me more.

00:18:11.123 --> 00:18:12.784
Wonderful...

00:18:14.393 --> 00:18:15.382
Shindo!

00:18:17.262 --> 00:18:18.251
Rokujo?

00:18:18.297 --> 00:18:21.357
He's a devil! You mustn't try
to face him head on!

00:18:22.501 --> 00:18:23.991
Rokujo...

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:33.369
Don't you want to see...

00:18:34.379 --> 00:18:36.870
...your true form?

00:18:41.086 --> 00:18:42.075
Shindo!

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:47.254
Heh, I know...

00:18:47.292 --> 00:18:49.760
...who I really am.

00:18:49.795 --> 00:18:51.524
I'm...

00:18:51.563 --> 00:18:53.155
...me!

00:18:59.872 --> 00:19:04.639
This is nothing to be surprised at.
This is providence.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.575
Shindo!

00:19:16.321 --> 00:19:17.549
Damn it!

00:19:17.589 --> 00:19:18.988
That's right...

00:19:19.024 --> 00:19:24.121
...and that providence is the power
to control everything.

00:19:24.163 --> 00:19:27.690
That power lies within you.

00:19:27.733 --> 00:19:28.791
What are you talking about!?

00:19:29.468 --> 00:19:34.929
You realize it, don't you?
That I'm the same as you.

00:19:34.973 --> 00:19:36.600
No, there is one difference.

00:19:36.642 --> 00:19:40.874
That is that I am one leap closer
to a new existence.

00:19:40.913 --> 00:19:46.351
It is a special privilege for only
the chosen few, like the two of us!

00:19:50.122 --> 00:19:51.282
Hmm?

00:19:53.292 --> 00:19:57.319
Stop saying things
that make no sense!

00:19:57.362 --> 00:20:00.559
Actually,
I have a present for you.

00:20:00.599 --> 00:20:01.588
What!?

00:20:01.633 --> 00:20:03.760
It's a wonderful present.

00:20:04.536 --> 00:20:07.096
Look forward to it.

00:20:47.012 --> 00:20:48.001
What is the meaning of this?

00:20:48.046 --> 00:20:49.673
Inspector Ibuki,

00:20:49.715 --> 00:20:51.740
there's a warrant out
for your arrest.

00:20:51.783 --> 00:20:52.772
What's the charge?

00:20:52.818 --> 00:20:56.219
Forging documents,
being an accomplice to...

00:20:56.255 --> 00:20:58.655
...and attempted murder.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.624
Of me, that is.

00:21:03.662 --> 00:21:04.651
What's the meaning of this?

00:21:04.696 --> 00:21:08.598
Inspector Ibuki is going to be taken
into custody.

00:21:08.634 --> 00:21:09.931
In addition, as of today,

00:21:09.968 --> 00:21:12.334
the second division
is being dissolved.

00:21:12.371 --> 00:21:13.395
That can't be...

00:21:14.439 --> 00:21:15.929
There's nothing I can do.

00:21:15.974 --> 00:21:21.002
And it looks like Inspector Ibuki
was prepared for this from the start.

00:21:21.046 --> 00:21:25.142
And isn't this actually better
for all of you?

00:21:25.183 --> 00:21:26.582
What do you mean?

00:21:26.618 --> 00:21:28.017
If there's no second division,

00:21:28.053 --> 00:21:30.021
then there's no need for you
to kill each other.

00:21:30.055 --> 00:21:33.149
In other words,
you're all free now.

00:21:33.191 --> 00:21:34.749
Isn't that a good thing?

00:21:39.631 --> 00:21:41.155
Don't misjudge us!

00:21:41.199 --> 00:21:44.259
Do you think we were doing this
because we wanted to live!?

00:21:46.305 --> 00:21:47.772
What's going to happen
to Ryouko?

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:53.400
They're not going to just let this go
without doing anything.

00:21:54.079 --> 00:21:56.877
If you're not careful...

00:21:56.915 --> 00:21:58.075
Saya...

00:22:00.185 --> 00:22:01.743
Hello!?

00:22:01.787 --> 00:22:03.880
There's no need to worry.

00:22:03.922 --> 00:22:07.153
Your precious little sister
is safe.

00:22:07.192 --> 00:22:09.387
I'll give her
back to you soon.

00:22:09.428 --> 00:22:10.520
What!?

00:22:10.562 --> 00:22:14.430
Of course, it'll be after she's been
awakened to her true power.

00:22:15.934 --> 00:22:18.596
That is my present to you.

00:22:20.072 --> 00:22:21.061
Why you!

00:22:22.941 --> 00:22:24.465
Saya...

